# CARTO basemap API key for the Leaflet maps (town-analysis + my-flat-insights).
#
# CARTO now enforces an API key on its public basemap CDN; without one, tiles render a
# "API KEY REQUIRED" watermark. This is a PUBLIC, client-side value — Astro inlines
# PUBLIC_-prefixed vars into the browser bundle, and the key rides in the tile URL — so
# it is not a secret, but we keep it out of git via .env (gitignored).
#
# Local dev: copy to `.env` (gitignored) and paste your key. Without it the maps still
# render, just with CARTO's watermark.
# Production: set as the `PUBLIC_CARTO_API_KEY` GitHub Actions secret (see deploy.yaml).
#
# Get a free key at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey
PUBLIC_CARTO_API_KEY=your-carto-api-key
